        "original_id": "c55ae1d1-240d-5172-b6c3-876ec1463c46",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Dustin Archbold, John D. Rockefeller\n- Companies: Standard Oil Company\n- Places: Archbold Gymnasium, Archbold Stadium, Carrier Dome, Manley Field House\n- Organizations: Syracuse University\n\nFacts:\n- John Dustin Archbold's small oil company was bought out by John D. Rockefeller's Standard Oil Company.\n- Archbold Gymnasium was built in 1908 with money donated by John Dustin Archbold.\n- John Dustin Archbold was a major benefactor of Syracuse University.\n- John Dustin Archbold also funded the building of Archbold Stadium just west of Archbold Gymnasium.\n- The Carrier Dome now occupies the site of Archbold Stadium.\n- Archbold Gymnasium served for almost 60 years before Manley Field House was built to replace it.",
